# Requests here get both folders' hooks: X-Run-Id (outer) and an admin
# bearer token (inner). The second request is skipped by the hook.

### Admin request
GET {{baseUrl}}/headers

> {%
  const h = res.json().headers;
  test("outer hook ran", () => expect(h["X-Run-Id"]).toBe(vars.get("runId")));
  test("inner hook ran", () => expect(h.Authorization).toBe("Bearer " + vars.get("adminToken")));
%}

### Destructive admin request (skipped unless --env staging)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/delete
X-Destructive: yes
